	"body": "<!-- synopkgland:release:synopackageland%2FSynoPkgGopeed:0.2.2-0037 -->\n\nDownload Hub **0.2.2-0037**\n\n0.2.2-0037\n- Removing the entry from its portal page asks for confirmation and explains how to enable it again from the DSM desktop.\n- Page headers keep titles and actions readable in narrow windows.\n\nPackage: `synopackageland/SynoPkgGopeed`\n\n[Browse packages](https://synopkgland.com/apps/)\n\n",
	"bodyHTML": "\n<p dir=\"auto\">Download Hub <strong>0.2.2-0037</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">0.2.2-0037</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Removing the entry from its portal page asks for confirmation and explains how to enable it again from the DSM desktop.</li>\n<li>Page headers keep titles and actions readable in narrow windows.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Package: <code class=\"notranslate\">synopackageland/SynoPkgGopeed</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://synopkgland.com/apps/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Browse packages</a></p>",
